From: BlackF1re <55582873+BlackF1re@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] drm: msm: dsi: force MSM8226 command-fetch clock

The Samsung MSM8226 driver programs DSI_CLK_CTRL=0x23f, including
FORCE_ON_DYN_AHBM_HCLK (bit9), when enabling the DSI controller. Mainline
currently programs only 0x3f. Command DMA times out on SM-T531 even with
valid, powered display IOMMU context state and correct pixel/byte clocks.

Model the verified factory setting as a host-configuration quirk only for
MSM8226. The existing XML already defines this hardware bit. This changes
no frequency, voltage, memory ownership or IRQ masking. Leave other host
configurations untouched; validate command completion on the device.

Source: LineageOS/android_kernel_samsung_msm8226 commit
3fa1853ed5d6c3a8ef5a2fda9822705243bbc256,
drivers/video/msm/mdss/mdss_dsi_host.c, mdss_dsi_host_init().

Signed-off-by: BlackF1re <55582873+BlackF1re@users.noreply.github.com>
---
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dsi/dsi_cfg.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dsi/dsi_cfg.c
index 828525128..9a2d9926d 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dsi/dsi_cfg.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dsi/dsi_cfg.c
@@ -56,6 +56,7 @@ static const struct regulator_bulk_data msm8226_dsi_regulators[] = {
 
 static const struct msm_dsi_config msm8226_dsi_cfg = {
 	.io_offset = DSI_6G_REG_SHIFT,
+	.force_ahbm_clk = true,
 	.regulator_data = msm8226_dsi_regulators,
 	.num_regulators = ARRAY_SIZE(msm8226_dsi_regulators),
 	.bus_clk_names = dsi_6g_bus_clk_names,
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dsi/dsi_cfg.h b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dsi/dsi_cfg.h
index c79925d16..4bee08b15 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dsi/dsi_cfg.h
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dsi/dsi_cfg.h
@@ -43,6 +43,7 @@
 
 struct msm_dsi_config {
 	u32 io_offset;
+	bool force_ahbm_clk;
 	const struct regulator_bulk_data *regulator_data;
 	int num_regulators;
 	const char * const *bus_clk_names;
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dsi/dsi_host.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dsi/dsi_host.c
index bd9a71a07..a9df0e255 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dsi/dsi_host.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dsi/dsi_host.c
@@ -909,7 +909,10 @@ static void dsi_ctrl_enable(struct msm_dsi_host *msm_host,
 
 	dsi_intr_ctrl(msm_host, DSI_IRQ_MASK_ERROR, 1);
 
-	dsi_write(msm_host, REG_DSI_CLK_CTRL, DSI_CLK_CTRL_ENABLE_CLKS);
+	data = DSI_CLK_CTRL_ENABLE_CLKS;
+	if (cfg_hnd->cfg->force_ahbm_clk)
+		data |= DSI_CLK_CTRL_FORCE_ON_DYN_AHBM_HCLK;
+	dsi_write(msm_host, REG_DSI_CLK_CTRL, data);
 
 	data = DSI_CTRL_CLK_EN;
 
